## Common Gotchas
- ❌ `new ethers.JsonRpcProvider()` is v6 — use `new ethers.providers.JsonRpcProvider()` (v5)
- ❌ `import { ethers } from "ethers"` is ESM — use `const { ethers } = require("ethers")`
- ❌ DA Layer URL `da-layer-coston2.flare.network` doesn't resolve — use `ctn2-data-availability.flare.network`
- ❌ FIRST_VOTING_ROUND `1658429955` gives wrong round IDs on Coston2 — use `1658430000`
- ❌ verifyXRPPayment is the correct function name on FdcVerification (not verifyPayment for XRP-specific)
